@startuml
' Pages (`newpage`) under one another, each with its heads and feet and
' the bars still open; numbers in levels (`autonumber 1.1.1`, raised by
' `autonumber inc A`); bars opened by the calls themselves (`autoactivate`).
title Checkout
autoactivate on
autonumber 1.1.1
Shopper -> Shop : add to cart
Shop -> Stock : reserve
return reserved
newpage Paying
autonumber inc A
Shop -> Bank : charge
Bank --> Shop : charged
return order placed
@enduml
